  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s uplift - Gender Empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work specifically with women and girls in the slums of Bangalore and Hyderabad to raise awareness of their rights and prevent gender-based discrimination and violence. It will build capacity in the slums so the women can address issues of violence and alcohol in the communities and help survivors of violence to access support services. It will also work with government departments and agencies to enable communities&#x2019; access to food security and other government welfare schemes.</narrative>
  </description>
